created: 2018/04/19 18:35:30
modified: 2018/04/19 18:35:30
category: (unfiled)/275
comment: Naoko Nakano Brown, Counselor, Seattle, WA, 98105, (206) 257-2701, Wanting to make a change and move forward, but feeling stuck?  It is often difficult to get a good grasp of your experience when you have a lot on your mind.   Sometimes it gets in your way of a wish to change.  It can be challenging to be kind and gentle to yourself as well as to your feelings at a time.  These experiences often make one feels stuck.  I believe, increasing awareness and understanding of experience(s) will help you to gain alternative perspectives that would help you to no longer feel stuck and/or afraid.

